{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a modern, premium and fully responsive FAQ / Information Accordion section for the Shopify Refine theme.
    
    Use the existing screenshot as the visual starting point, but significantly improve the UI while keeping the design clean and consistent with TOOSA's branding.
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE:
    
    Create a centered FAQ section with:
    - Optional small eyebrow text
    - Main section heading
    - Optional short description
    - Multiple FAQ categories/groups
    - Accordion questions and answers under each category
    
    Example categories:
    - Getting Started
    - Shipping
    - Returns
    - Product Information
    - Warranty
    - Orders
    
    DESKTOP LAYOUT:
    
    - Use a clean centered container with a maximum width of approximately 1200–1400px.
    - Each category should have a clear heading.
    - Add a subtle divider below category headings.
    - FAQ items should have generous vertical spacing.
    - Question text should be medium/semi-bold.
    - Answer text should have slightly smaller typography and comfortable line-height.
    - Place the expand/collapse icon on the right.
    - Use a clean plus (+) icon when closed and minus (−) when opened.
    - Make the entire question row clickable.
    - Add subtle hover effects.
    - The active/open FAQ should have a clear visual state without looking heavy.
    - Avoid excessive borders and shadows.
    
    PREMIUM UI STYLE:
    
    - Minimal, modern editorial design.
    - White or configurable light background.
    - Dark navy/black text.
    - TOOSA orange as an optional accent color.
    - Thin light-gray dividers.
    - Large clean section heading.
    - Comfortable whitespace.
    - Rounded corners should be configurable and subtle.
    - Optional soft background for FAQ answer area.
    - Do not use excessive cards or heavy shadows.
    
    FAQ ACCORDION BEHAVIOR:
    
    - Clicking a question opens its answer.
    - Clicking again closes it.
    - Smooth height/opacity transition.
    - Allow one FAQ to remain open at a time OR provide a Theme Editor option for multiple open items.
    - First FAQ can optionally be open by default.
    - Use accessible buttons rather than clickable divs.
    - Add proper aria-expanded and aria-controls attributes.
    - Support keyboard navigation.
    - No external JavaScript libraries.
    
    MOBILE DESIGN:
    
    - Fully responsive.
    - Stack all content vertically.
    - Reduce heading size automatically.
    - Use comfortable horizontal padding around 16–20px.
    - FAQ question rows should have a minimum touch target of approximately 48px.
    - Keep expand/collapse icons clearly visible.
    - Answers should remain easy to read.
    - Prevent horizontal scrolling.
    - Category headings should have strong visual separation.
    - Optimize spacing so the section does not become excessively long.
    
    SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR CUSTOMIZATION:
    
    Add customizable settings for:
    
    SECTION:
    - Section heading
    - Eyebrow text
    - Description
    - Text alignment
    - Maximum section width
    - Background color
    - Text color
    - Accent color
    - Top padding
    - Bottom padding
    - Desktop spacing
    - Mobile spacing
    
    FAQ CATEGORY:
    - Category title
    - Category title size
    - Category spacing
    
    FAQ BLOCK:
    Each FAQ should be created as a Shopify block with:
    - Question
    - Answer / rich text
    - Open by default toggle
    - Optional icon
    - Optional custom accent color
    
    STYLE SETTINGS:
    - Question font size
    - Answer font size
    - Question font weight
    - Divider color
    - Divider thickness
    - Border radius
    - Answer background color
    - Show/hide dividers
    - Show/hide category headings
    - Accordion animation speed
    
    FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS:
    
    - Shopify OS 2.0 compatible.
    - Compatible with the Refine theme.
    - Use Liquid, CSS and vanilla JavaScript only.
    - Do not use external libraries.
    - Do not affect other theme sections.
    - Scope all CSS to the section ID.
    - Use Shopify's existing typography and design system where possible.
    - Support rich text inside FAQ answers.
    - Allow unlimited FAQ blocks.
    - Allow unlimited FAQ categories where practical.
    - Make the section reusable multiple times on the same page.
    - Ensure there are no Liquid schema errors.
    - Ensure all settings have valid Shopify schema types and defaults.
    
    DESIRED VISUAL RESULT:
    
    The final design should look like a premium modern FAQ/help section rather than a basic accordion.
    
    Desktop:
    
                    FAQ / INFORMATION
            Frequently Asked Questions
            Find answers to common questions.
    
    GETTING STARTED
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    How do your sizes work?                         +
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    What products do you offer?                     +
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    
    SHIPPING
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    Do you ship internationally?                    +
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    How much is shipping?                            +
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    What is your return policy?                      +
    
    On opening:
    
    Do you ship internationally?                    −
    Currently we are only shipping to USA and
    Canada. Add comfortable spacing here.
    ────────────────────────────────────────
    
    On mobile, use a clean single-column accordion
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-faq-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-faq-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-faq-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.category_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-category-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.category_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.category_title_spacing }}px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .ai-faq-category-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: {{ block.settings.divider_thickness }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.item_spacing }}px;
    border: none;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.divider_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.question_padding }}px 0;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: all {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}ms ease;
    min-height: 48px;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: 2px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.question_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    padding-right: 20px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}ms ease;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}ms ease, opacity {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}ms ease;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-answer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 0 0 {{ block.settings.answer_padding }}px 0;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.7;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.answer_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.answer_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .ai-faq-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-category-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.category_title_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.category_spacing | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
    .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height:18px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank or block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
          <div class="ai-faq-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-faq-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        
        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-faq-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% liquid
      assign faq_1_category = block.settings.faq_1_category
      assign faq_2_category = block.settings.faq_2_category
      assign faq_3_category = block.settings.faq_3_category
      assign faq_4_category = block.settings.faq_4_category
      assign faq_5_category = block.settings.faq_5_category
      assign faq_6_category = block.settings.faq_6_category
      assign faq_7_category = block.settings.faq_7_category
      assign faq_8_category = block.settings.faq_8_category
      assign faq_9_category = block.settings.faq_9_category
      assign faq_10_category = block.settings.faq_10_category

      assign categories = ''
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_1_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_2_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_3_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_4_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_5_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_6_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_7_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_8_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_9_category | append: '|'
      assign categories = categories | append: faq_10_category

      assign category_array = categories | split: '|'
      assign unique_categories = ''
    %}

    {% for cat in category_array %}
      {% unless unique_categories contains cat or cat == blank %}
        {% assign unique_categories = unique_categories | append: cat | append: '|' %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}

    {% assign unique_categories_array = unique_categories | split: '|' %}

    {% for category in unique_categories_array %}
      {% if category != blank %}
        {% if block.settings.show_categories %}
          <div class="ai-faq-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <h3 class="ai-faq-category-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ category }}</h3>
            {% if block.settings.show_dividers %}
              <hr class="ai-faq-category-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% endif %}
        {% endif %}

        {% for i in (1..10) %}
          {% assign category_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_category' %}
          {% assign question_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_question' %}
          {% assign answer_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_answer' %}
          {% assign open_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_open' %}

          {% assign item_category = block.settings[category_key] %}
          {% assign item_question = block.settings[question_key] %}
          {% assign item_answer = block.settings[answer_key] %}
          {% assign item_open = block.settings[open_key] %}

          {% if item_category == category and item_question != blank %}
            <div 
              class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if item_open %}active{% endif %}"
              data-faq-item
            >
              <button
                class="ai-faq-question-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                aria-expanded="{% if item_open %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                aria-controls="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}"
                data-faq-button
              >
                <h4 class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ item_question }}</h4>
                <div class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                    <line class="ai-faq-icon-horizontal-{{ ai_gen_id }}" x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </button>
              
              <div 
                class="ai-faq-answer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                id="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}"
                data-faq-answer
              >
                <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ item_answer }}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}

        {% if block.settings.show_categories %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.allowMultiple = {{ block.settings.allow_multiple_open }};
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.items = this.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-item]');
        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.initializeOpenItems();
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        this.items.forEach((item) => {
          const button = item.querySelector('[data-faq-button]');

          button.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const isActive = item.classList.contains('active');

            if (!this.allowMultiple) {
              this.items.forEach((otherItem) => {
                if (otherItem !== item && otherItem.classList.contains('active')) {
                  this.closeItem(otherItem);
                }
              });
            }

            if (isActive) {
              this.closeItem(item);
            } else {
              this.openItem(item);
            }
          });
        });
      }

      initializeOpenItems() {
        this.items.forEach((item) => {
          if (item.classList.contains('active')) {
            const answer = item.querySelector('[data-faq-answer]');
            answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
          }
        });
      }

      openItem(item) {
        const button = item.querySelector('[data-faq-button]');
        const answer = item.querySelector('[data-faq-answer]');

        item.classList.add('active');
        button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
        answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
      }

      closeItem(item) {
        const button = item.querySelector('[data-faq-button]');
        const answer = item.querySelector('[data-faq-answer]');

        item.classList.remove('active');
        button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        answer.style.maxHeight = '0';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ accordion",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "faq-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section header"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow text",
      "default": "FAQ / INFORMATION"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "Find answers to common questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "eyebrow_size",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Eyebrow size",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "min": 24,
      "max": 72,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "description_size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Description size",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "heading_font",
      "label": "Heading font",
      "default": "assistant_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
